   "source": [
    "# Ders 5: Performans Ölçme ve Regularizasyon\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "59f80e7e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import PolynomialFeatures\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import Ridge, Lasso, LinearRegression\n",
    "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split, cross_val_score\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "print(\"Kutuphaneler hazir.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "42f6653b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Bias-Variance Tradeoff (Ch. 8.2)\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{Hata} = \\underbrace{\\text{Bias}^2}_{\\text{yetersiz uyum}} + \\underbrace{\\text{Varyans}}_{\\text{aşırı uyum}} + \\underbrace{\\text{Gürültü}}_{\\text{azaltılamaz}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Yüksek bias (underfitting)**: Model çok basit → eğitim ve test kaybı yüksek\n",
    "- **Yüksek varyans (overfitting)**: Model çok karmaşık → eğitim düşük, test yüksek\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "61482492",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Polinom derecesi artıkça bias-variance tradeoff\n",
    "np.random.seed(0)\n",
    "N_train = 30\n",
    "x_all = np.linspace(-3, 3, 200)\n",
    "y_true_fn = lambda x: np.sin(x) + 0.3*x\n",
    "\n",
    "x_train = np.random.uniform(-3, 3, N_train)\n",
    "y_train = y_true_fn(x_train) + np.random.randn(N_train) * 0.4\n",
    "\n",
    "x_test = np.random.uniform(-3, 3, 100)\n",
    "y_test  = y_true_fn(x_test)  + np.random.randn(100) * 0.4\n",
    "\n",
    "degrees = [1, 3, 6, 12]\n",
    "train_errs, test_errs = [], []\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 4, figsize=(16, 4))\n",
    "for ax, deg in zip(axes, degrees):\n",
    "    pipe = Pipeline([('poly', PolynomialFeatures(deg)), ('lr', LinearRegression())])\n",
    "    pipe.fit(x_train.reshape(-1,1), y_train)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    y_pred_train = pipe.predict(x_train.reshape(-1,1))\n",
    "    y_pred_test  = pipe.predict(x_test.reshape(-1,1))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    tr_err = np.mean((y_pred_train - y_train)**2)\n",
    "    te_err = np.mean((y_pred_test  - y_test)**2)\n",
    "    train_errs.append(tr_err); test_errs.append(te_err)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    y_plot = pipe.predict(x_all.reshape(-1,1))\n",
    "    ax.scatter(x_train, y_train, s=20, alpha=0.6, color='gray', label=\"Egitim\")\n",
    "    ax.plot(x_all, y_true_fn(x_all), 'g--', lw=1.5, label=\"Gercek\")\n",
    "    ax.plot(x_all, y_plot, 'crimson', lw=2, label=f\"Model\")\n",
    "    ax.set_ylim(-3, 3)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f\"Derece {deg}\\nEgitim:{tr_err:.3f} Test:{te_err:.3f}\")\n",
    "    ax.legend(fontsize=7); ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Polinom Derecesi: Underfitting -> Overfitting\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_bias_var.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Eğitim/test hata eğrisi\n",
    "fig2, ax2 = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
    "ax2.plot(degrees, train_errs, '-o', color='steelblue', lw=2, label=\"Egitim Hatasi\")\n",
    "ax2.plot(degrees, test_errs,  '-o', color='crimson',   lw=2, label=\"Test Hatasi\")\n",
    "ax2.set_xlabel(\"Polinom Derecesi\"); ax2.set_ylabel(\"MSE\")\n",
    "ax2.set_title(\"Egitim vs Test Hatasi (Model Karmasikligina Gore)\")\n",
    "ax2.legend(); ax2.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "ax2.annotate(\"Underfitting\", xy=(1, test_errs[0]), xytext=(1.3, test_errs[0]+0.05),\n",
    "             fontsize=10, color='orange')\n",
    "ax2.annotate(\"Overfitting\", xy=(12, test_errs[-1]), xytext=(9, test_errs[-1]+0.05),\n",
    "             fontsize=10, color='red')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_bias_var2.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "799fcf04",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Double Descent (Ch. 8.4)\n",
    "\n",
    "Klasik istatistikte model karmaşıklığı arttıkça test hatası U-şeklinde artar.  \n",
    "Ancak büyük derin öğrenme modellerinde **ikinci bir iniş** gözlemlenir:  \n",
    "model interpolasyon eşiğini geçince test hatası tekrar **düşer**.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "acfb8124",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Double descent kavramsal simülasyonu\n",
    "# Parametre sayısı arttıkça klasik U + ikinci iniş\n",
    "\n",
    "n_params = np.array([2, 5, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 75, 100, 150, 200, 300, 500])\n",
    "# Interpolation threshold yaklaşık n=30 (veri sayısı kadar parametre)\n",
    "# Bölge 1: bias azalır (n<30)\n",
    "# Bölge 2: interpolation eşiği, maksimum (n~30)\n",
    "# Bölge 3: double descent (n>>30)\n",
    "\n",
    "def double_descent_curve(n, n_data=30, noise=0.3):\n",
    "    if n < n_data:\n",
    "        return 1.5 - 0.04*n + noise*np.random.randn()\n",
    "    elif n < n_data * 1.2:\n",
    "        t = (n - n_data) / (n_data * 0.2)\n",
    "        return 0.7 + 2.5*np.exp(-t) + noise*np.random.randn()\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        return 0.2 + 8.0/n + noise*np.random.randn()*0.3\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(5)\n",
    "test_errs_dd = [max(0.1, double_descent_curve(n)) for n in n_params]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(n_params, test_errs_dd, '-o', color='steelblue', lw=2, markersize=6)\n",
    "ax.axvline(30, color='red', linestyle='--', lw=1.5, label=\"Interpolasyon esigi (~veri sayisi)\")\n",
    "ax.fill_betweenx([0, 3.5], 0, 30, alpha=0.08, color='orange', label=\"Klasik rejim\")\n",
    "ax.fill_betweenx([0, 3.5], 30, 500, alpha=0.08, color='blue', label=\"Modern (asiri parametre)\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Parametre Sayisi (model karmasikligi)\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Test Hatasi\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Double Descent Egrisi\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "ax.legend(fontsize=10); ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 3.5)\n",
    "ax.annotate(\"Underfitting\", xy=(5, 1.3), fontsize=10, color='orange')\n",
    "ax.annotate(\"Interpolasyon\\nEsigi\", xy=(28, 2.8), fontsize=9, color='red')\n",
    "ax.annotate(\"Overfitted\\nmodel iyi genelliyor\", xy=(150, 0.4), fontsize=10, color='blue')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_double_descent.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dd2e60d1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. L2 Regularizasyon (Weight Decay) — Ch. 9.1\n",
    "\n",
    "$$L_{reg} = L_{data} + \\lambda \\|\\theta\\|^2$$\n",
    "\n",
    "λ büyük → parametreler küçük kalır → model basitleşir → overfitting azalır\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "23938302",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Ridge (L2) vs Lasso (L1) vs Düzleştirilmemiş\n",
    "np.random.seed(3)\n",
    "from sklearn.datasets import make_regression\n",
    "\n",
    "X_r, y_r = make_regression(n_samples=80, n_features=20, noise=15, random_state=42)\n",
    "X_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X_r, y_r, test_size=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "alphas = np.logspace(-3, 4, 50)\n",
    "\n",
    "ridge_train, ridge_test = [], []\n",
    "lasso_train, lasso_test = [], []\n",
    "\n",
    "for a in alphas:\n",
    "    r = Ridge(alpha=a).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n",
    "    ridge_train.append(np.mean((r.predict(X_tr)-y_tr)**2))\n",
    "    ridge_test.append(np.mean((r.predict(X_te)-y_te)**2))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    l = Lasso(alpha=a, max_iter=5000).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n",
    "    lasso_train.append(np.mean((l.predict(X_tr)-y_tr)**2))\n",
    "    lasso_test.append(np.mean((l.predict(X_te)-y_te)**2))\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].semilogx(alphas, ridge_train, 'steelblue', lw=2, label=\"Egitim\")\n",
    "axes[0].semilogx(alphas, ridge_test,  'crimson',   lw=2, label=\"Test\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Ridge (L2) — lambda vs Hata\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"lambda\"); axes[0].set_ylabel(\"MSE\")\n",
    "axes[0].legend(); axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].semilogx(alphas, lasso_train, 'steelblue', lw=2, label=\"Egitim\")\n",
    "axes[1].semilogx(alphas, lasso_test,  'crimson',   lw=2, label=\"Test\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Lasso (L1) — lambda vs Hata\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"lambda\"); axes[1].set_ylabel(\"MSE\")\n",
    "axes[1].legend(); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_regularization.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "644e99ca",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Dropout (Ch. 9.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "Eğitim sırasında rastgele nöronlar devre dışı bırakılır (p olasılığıyla).  \n",
    "Bu, farklı ağ yapılarının topluluğunu (ensemble) simüle eder.  \n",
    "Test zamanında tüm nöronlar aktif, ağırlıklar (1-p) ile ölçeklenir.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "debcb030",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def dropout_forward(h, p_drop=0.3, training=True):\n",
    "    if not training:\n",
    "        return h  # test: tum noronlar aktif\n",
    "    mask = (np.random.rand(*h.shape) > p_drop).astype(float)\n",
    "    return h * mask / (1 - p_drop)  # inverted dropout\n",
    "\n",
    "# Dropout maskesi görselleştirmesi\n",
    "np.random.seed(7)\n",
    "h_example = np.ones((5, 10))\n",
    "p_values = [0.0, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7]\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 4, figsize=(14, 3))\n",
    "for ax, p in zip(axes, p_values):\n",
    "    masked = dropout_forward(h_example, p_drop=p, training=True)\n",
    "    active = (masked > 0).astype(int)\n",
    "    ax.imshow(active, cmap='Blues', vmin=0, vmax=1, aspect='auto')\n",
    "    active_pct = active.mean() * 100\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f\"Dropout p={p}\\n{active_pct:.0f}% aktif noron\")\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel(\"Noronlar\"); ax.set_ylabel(\"Ornekler\")\n",
    "    for i in range(5):\n",
    "        for j in range(10):\n",
    "            ax.text(j, i, str(active[i,j]), ha='center', va='center', fontsize=8,\n",
    "                   color='white' if active[i,j] else 'gray')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Dropout: Farkli Oranlarda Noron Devre Disi Birakma\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_dropout.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "10cc9aeb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Batch Normalization (Ch. 9.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "Her mini-batch içinde aktivasyonları normalize eder:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\hat{x}_i = \\frac{x_i - \\mu_B}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_B^2 + \\epsilon}}, \\quad y_i = \\gamma \\hat{x}_i + \\beta$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Bu, her katmanın girdi dağılımını sabit tutar → **daha hızlı eğitim**, **daha yüksek öğrenme hızı** kullanılabilir.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "444354e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def batch_norm_forward(x, gamma=1.0, beta=0.0, eps=1e-8):\n",
    "    mu = x.mean(axis=0)\n",
    "    var = x.var(axis=0)\n",
    "    x_hat = (x - mu) / np.sqrt(var + eps)\n",
    "    return gamma * x_hat + beta, mu, var\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(2)\n",
    "x_raw = np.random.randn(100, 1) * 5 + 10  # Kotu: ortalama!=0, std!=1\n",
    "x_bn, mu, var = batch_norm_forward(x_raw)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 4))\n",
    "axes[0].hist(x_raw, bins=25, color='crimson', edgecolor='white', alpha=0.8)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(f\"BatchNorm Oncesi\\nMean={x_raw.mean():.1f}, Std={x_raw.std():.1f}\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Aktivasyon degeri\")\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].hist(x_bn, bins=25, color='steelblue', edgecolor='white', alpha=0.8)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(f\"BatchNorm Sonrasi\\nMean={x_bn.mean():.3f}, Std={x_bn.std():.3f}\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Normalize aktivasyon\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Batch Normalization: Aktivasyon Dagilimi Normalizasyonu\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_batchnorm.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6541ee88",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Erken Durdurma (Early Stopping)\n",
    "\n",
    "Validation kaybı artmaya başladığında eğitimi durdur.  \n",
    "Bu de facto bir regularizasyon tekniğidir: eğitim adımı sayısını kısıtlar.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f108d1e9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Erken durdurma simülasyonu\n",
    "np.random.seed(9)\n",
    "epochs = np.arange(1, 201)\n",
    "train_loss = 1.0 * np.exp(-0.02*epochs) + 0.03*np.random.randn(200)*0.5\n",
    "val_loss = 1.0 * np.exp(-0.015*epochs) + 0.1*(epochs/200)**1.5 + 0.05*np.random.randn(200)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Smoothing\n",
    "from scipy.ndimage import uniform_filter1d\n",
    "train_smooth = uniform_filter1d(np.abs(train_loss), size=5)\n",
    "val_smooth   = uniform_filter1d(np.abs(val_loss), size=5)\n",
    "\n",
    "best_epoch = np.argmin(val_smooth)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(epochs, train_smooth, 'steelblue', lw=2, label=\"Egitim kaybi\")\n",
    "ax.plot(epochs, val_smooth,   'crimson',   lw=2, label=\"Validasyon kaybi\")\n",
    "ax.axvline(best_epoch+1, color='green', linestyle='--', lw=2, \n",
    "           label=f\"Erken durdurma ({best_epoch+1}. epoch)\")\n",
    "ax.fill_betweenx([0, 1.2], best_epoch+1, 200, alpha=0.1, color='red', label=\"Gereksiz egitim\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Erken Durdurma (Early Stopping)\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Epoch\"); ax.set_ylabel(\"Kayip\")\n",
    "ax.legend(); ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 1.2)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb05_early_stop.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(f\"En iyi epoch: {best_epoch+1}, val kaybi: {val_smooth[best_epoch]:.4f}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ad284c8b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Özet\n",
    "\n",
    "| Teknik | Tür | Etki |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **L2 (Ridge)** | Explicit reg. | Büyük ağırlıkları cezalandırır |\n",
    "| **L1 (Lasso)** | Explicit reg. | Seyrek çözüm, özellik seçimi |\n",
    "| **Dropout** | Implicit reg. | Ensemble etkisi, ko-adaptasyon engeli |\n",
    "| **Batch Norm** | Heuristic | Eğitimi hızlandırır, büyük lr mümkün |\n",
    "| **Erken Durdurma** | Implicit reg. | Aşırı öğrenme öncesi dur |\n",
    "| **Veri artırma** | Implicit reg. | Veri çeşitliliğini artırır |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Sonraki Notebook →** Evrişimsel Sinir Ağları (CNN) ve ResNet\n"
   ]
  }
